(6003262, 879836, 104841, '<td valign="top">I like the reoccurring geometrical patterns that reoccur in your shot here. I however do not like what you have done with the postproduction, why are the figures 100% black?</td>', 'I like the reoccurring geometrical patterns that reoccur in your shot here. I however do not like what you have done with the postproduction, why are the figures 100% black?', '2010-05-12 06:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003266, 879221, 104841, '<td valign="top">I like your really dramatic sky here and having a person in shot does help provided a sense of size to the shot should you perhaps got closer to him?</td>', 'I like your really dramatic sky here and having a person in shot does help provided a sense of size to the shot should you perhaps got closer to him?', '2010-05-12 06:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003269, 879621, 104841, '<td valign="top">cute bird shot, pity that leaf got in the way. Also there appears to be a slight halo around the birds head.</td>', 'cute bird shot, pity that leaf got in the way. Also there appears to be a slight halo around the birds head.', '2010-05-12 06:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003272, 879233, 104841, '<td valign="top">I quite like you shot with its dark Gothic palate. As you have done the postproduction some white lines have been introduced around the branches which i find slightly distracting.</td>', 'I quite like you shot with its dark Gothic palate. As you have done the postproduction some white lines have been introduced around the branches which i find slightly distracting.', '2010-05-12 07:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003278, 880097, 104841, '<td valign="top">what a gloomy cold day. I see what you were trying to do with the window planes but it is slightly off, if it wasn''t I think it would be quite a good mono shot.</td>', 'what a gloomy cold day. I see what you were trying to do with the window planes but it is slightly off, if it wasn''t I think it would be quite a good mono shot.', '2010-05-12 07:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003282, 879231, 104841, '<td valign="top">I like your dark sky and wispy clouds, I would have like to see some more of the mountains though.</td>', 'I like your dark sky and wispy clouds, I would have like to see some more of the mountains though.', '2010-05-12 07:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
