(6003907, 878621, 108580, '<td valign="top">The SRT101 has a special place in my heart. It was the first SLR I picked up in ''79 and it was a mainstay for many years, mostly slide, before I "upgraded" to an XG-M and XD-7. Sadly she was stolen by an affirmative shopper (housebreaker) along with almost all our other Minolta gear.<br/> <br/>This image is well taken, composed, lit and titled. The 101 is also in very good condition and very photogenic :) Hold on to her!</td>', 'The SRT101 has a special place in my heart. It was the first SLR I picked up in ''79 and it was a mainstay for many years, mostly slide, before I "upgraded" to an XG-M and XD-7. Sadly she was stolen by an affirmative shopper (housebreaker) along with almost all our other Minolta gear. This image is well taken, composed, lit and titled. The 101 is also in very good condition and very photogenic :) Hold on to her!', '2010-05-12 12:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003943, 878765, 60698, '<td valign="top">Hahaha! Love the humor in this one and the processing really is perfect! Looks like a long trek for a 10 second timer!</td>', 'Hahaha! Love the humor in this one and the processing really is perfect! Looks like a long trek for a 10 second timer!', '2010-05-12 13:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003953, 879680, 96751, '<td valign="top">I like the pp''ing on this.  Very interesting.</td>', 'I like the pp''ing on this.  Very interesting.', '2010-05-12 13:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003955, 880004, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the sky on this</td>', 'I love the sky on this', '2010-05-12 13:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003971, 880511, 12848, '<td valign="top">Very good picture. Too much noise though.</td>', 'Very good picture. Too much noise though.', '2010-05-12 13:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003976, 880132, 108580, '<td valign="top">Arty, vibey. Nice eye for an abstract you have!</td>', 'Arty, vibey. Nice eye for an abstract you have!', '2010-05-12 13:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003982, 879795, 12848, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors</td>', 'Lovely colors', '2010-05-12 13:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003988, 880145, 115307, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Great clarity, and your subject is contrasted very nicely with the blue water.<br/>I think it would have worked even better if the shot wasn''t so tight. I would like to see more of the world he is standing on :-)</td>', 'Nice photo. Great clarity, and your subject is contrasted very nicely with the blue water.I think it would have worked even better if the shot wasn''t so tight. I would like to see more of the world he is standing on :-)', '2010-05-12 13:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003992, 880226, 115307, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo. You have captured a marvelous scene, and I love the sepia you have chosen to add and the vignetting.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo. You have captured a marvelous scene, and I love the sepia you have chosen to add and the vignetting.', '2010-05-12 13:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003993, 879540, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness!  That is too much cute for one dose!  I''m suffering mightily from the overdose  :)  FABULOUS!!!</td>', 'Ohmygoodness!  That is too much cute for one dose!  I''m suffering mightily from the overdose  :)  FABULOUS!!!', '2010-05-12 13:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003996, 880261, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Absolute PERFECTION! I''m in awe!</td>', 'Wow!  Absolute PERFECTION! I''m in awe!', '2010-05-12 13:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6003997, 879680, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful flowers, but I am not sure I agree with the editing you have chosen for this. Of course, I don''t know what the original looks like, so I can''t really judge.<br/>The mountains are really brought out nicely with your use of the rule of thirds</td>', 'Very beautiful flowers, but I am not sure I agree with the editing you have chosen for this. Of course, I don''t know what the original looks like, so I can''t really judge.The mountains are really brought out nicely with your use of the rule of thirds', '2010-05-12 13:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004002, 879592, 115307, '<td valign="top">Love the photo, but do not like the border. And I am guessing I will not be the only one who says that.<br/>I think this photo would be equally strong, and probably stronger without it.<br/>I really like the capture of this bird. Nice detail, and I like that he is looking over his shoulder at you. For some reason he strikes me as having a great sense of humor,<br/>The photo is a little top heavy, but with a bird like that, I don''t know how you would do it otherwise.</td>', 'Love the photo, but do not like the border. And I am guessing I will not be the only one who says that.I think this photo would be equally strong, and probably stronger without it.I really like the capture of this bird. Nice detail, and I like that he is looking over his shoulder at you. For some reason he strikes me as having a great sense of humor,The photo is a little top heavy, but with a bird like that, I don''t know how you would do it otherwise.', '2010-05-12 13:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004007, 879854, 115307, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out the really bright building on the right. It keeps dragging my eye away from the fireworks. The leading lines of the smoke keep heading straight there as well, so I find myself staring at the wrong thing.<br/>Beautiful night shot though. I love the colors, especially in the reflection of the water.</td>', 'I would have cropped out the really bright building on the right. It keeps dragging my eye away from the fireworks. The leading lines of the smoke keep heading straight there as well, so I find myself staring at the wrong thing.Beautiful night shot though. I love the colors, especially in the reflection of the water.', '2010-05-12 13:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004013, 879496, 115307, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! I love the pastel colors in the sky, and the yellow buildings contrast beautifully.<br/>I also like how depth is created here. My eye starts out looking at the foremost building on the right, and then zooms to the back of the image on the left.<br/>Unfortunately, the tree is a total eye sore for me, but a completely unavoidable subject as well.</td>', 'Beautiful shot! I love the pastel colors in the sky, and the yellow buildings contrast beautifully.I also like how depth is created here. My eye starts out looking at the foremost building on the right, and then zooms to the back of the image on the left.Unfortunately, the tree is a total eye sore for me, but a completely unavoidable subject as well.', '2010-05-12 13:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004016, 878812, 115307, '<td valign="top">Hey! We own that toy stand thingy! I am almost positive.<br/>Beautiful baby, and I love what you have done with the eyes. Assuming you are the parent, this is a picture you will be holding on to for a long time :-)</td>', 'Hey! We own that toy stand thingy! I am almost positive.Beautiful baby, and I love what you have done with the eyes. Assuming you are the parent, this is a picture you will be holding on to for a long time :-)', '2010-05-12 13:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004021, 878770, 115307, '<td valign="top">Personally, I would have cropped out the little blue hot air balloon on the right. To me it unbalances the composition of this photo. All this heavy imagery on one side, and then this itty bitty thing has to hold the weight of the other. If you crop it out, the feeling of imbalance goes away.<br/>Lovely shot though. The guy with the bright yellow vest really puts the icing on the cake.</td>', 'Personally, I would have cropped out the little blue hot air balloon on the right. To me it unbalances the composition of this photo. All this heavy imagery on one side, and then this itty bitty thing has to hold the weight of the other. If you crop it out, the feeling of imbalance goes away.Lovely shot though. The guy with the bright yellow vest really puts the icing on the cake.', '2010-05-12 13:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004027, 879151, 115307, '<td valign="top">Personally, I do not like the severely tilted angle. To me it is a little disconcerting. Its a little hard to describe but I will do my best. Basically, I feel like my eye is following the gravity of this shot and sliding down the slope from the right to the left. This leads me staring at an uninteresting wall rather than your beautiful subject. To pull my eyes away to look back at your subject is like climbing the hill, an effort.<br/>Otherwise, it is a nice portrait, and I am loving her hair especially :-)</td>', 'Personally, I do not like the severely tilted angle. To me it is a little disconcerting. Its a little hard to describe but I will do my best. Basically, I feel like my eye is following the gravity of this shot and sliding down the slope from the right to the left. This leads me staring at an uninteresting wall rather than your beautiful subject. To pull my eyes away to look back at your subject is like climbing the hill, an effort.Otherwise, it is a nice portrait, and I am loving her hair especially :-)', '2010-05-12 13:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004028, 880146, 115307, '<td valign="top">A little too soft for my taste, but then again, I can see that that was also partly what you were going for. This would have worked beautifully in the Bokeh challenge that is coming up. I am loving the background colors. Very peaceful and serene.</td>', 'A little too soft for my taste, but then again, I can see that that was also partly what you were going for. This would have worked beautifully in the Bokeh challenge that is coming up. I am loving the background colors. Very peaceful and serene.', '2010-05-12 13:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004030, 878877, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but it is a little too busy for me. I do not know where I am supposed to be looking at, so my eye keeps dashing randomly across the photo. A strong main subject would also make a stronger photo.<br/>This seems like it is a beautiful place.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but it is a little too busy for me. I do not know where I am supposed to be looking at, so my eye keeps dashing randomly across the photo. A strong main subject would also make a stronger photo.This seems like it is a beautiful place.', '2010-05-12 13:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004032, 878501, 115307, '<td valign="top">Love the shades of blue here. But I find myself staring at the tag (or whatever it is) in the bottom left corner, instead of your main subject.</td>', 'Love the shades of blue here. But I find myself staring at the tag (or whatever it is) in the bottom left corner, instead of your main subject.', '2010-05-12 13:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004036, 880312, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, but the image does seem a little soft to me.<br/>You have captured some lovely flowers, that would really pop if there was just a bit more focus.</td>', 'I love the colors, but the image does seem a little soft to me.You have captured some lovely flowers, that would really pop if there was just a bit more focus.', '2010-05-12 13:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004043, 879540, 115307, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness, cuteness overload! Images like this really should come with a Warning Sign :-P<br/>I have been leaving critiques on every image I have commented on, but at this point I can''t even think straight, all I am thinking is SOOOOOOOOO CUTE. Well done 8</td>', 'Oh my goodness, cuteness overload! Images like this really should come with a Warning Sign :-PI have been leaving critiques on every image I have commented on, but at this point I can''t even think straight, all I am thinking is SOOOOOOOOO CUTE. Well done 8', '2010-05-12 14:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
