(6004558, 879803, 113419, '<td valign="top">very pretty girl and a beautiful smile! please keep in mind this is just my opinion....for what its worth....I find the hair over her eye combined with the sun there on that branch very distracting as well as the white flower "on" her shoulder; I think if she had been facing the camera fully and someone had pulled that flower out of the way it would have been a much better shot.</td>', 'very pretty girl and a beautiful smile! please keep in mind this is just my opinion....for what its worth....I find the hair over her eye combined with the sun there on that branch very distracting as well as the white flower "on" her shoulder; I think if she had been facing the camera fully and someone had pulled that flower out of the way it would have been a much better shot.', '2010-05-12 18:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
