(6004863, 879952, 13688, '<td valign="top">this took awhile to start to appreciate the interesting tones.  you have definitely captured the oddness of this animal with a fairly odd photo.  i would have liked to see it composed without the drain and that thing under the beard, but maybe you included them to add to the oddness-9</td>', 'this took awhile to start to appreciate the interesting tones.  you have definitely captured the oddness of this animal with a fairly odd photo.  i would have liked to see it composed without the drain and that thing under the beard, but maybe you included them to add to the oddness-9', '2010-05-12 22:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004895, 879621, 60698, '<td valign="top">They don''t get too much better than this! Beautiful!</td>', 'They don''t get too much better than this! Beautiful!', '2010-05-12 22:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004898, 880507, 30791, '<td valign="top">oh that''s how you say it....</td>', 'oh that''s how you say it....', '2010-05-12 22:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004903, 879368, 13688, '<td valign="top">your photo is hard to look at, but I find that interesting given it does involve the death of a flower.    Many on this site might try to make it a triumphant death with strong contrast, sharp focus, higher saturation, and a rule of thirds positioning.  I appreciate your choices.  That phrase "triumphant death" inadvertently reminded me of Pieter Bruegel the Elder and I re-enjoyed his work on the small detour i just took, so thanks-9</td>', 'your photo is hard to look at, but I find that interesting given it does involve the death of a flower.    Many on this site might try to make it a triumphant death with strong contrast, sharp focus, higher saturation, and a rule of thirds positioning.  I appreciate your choices.  That phrase "triumphant death" inadvertently reminded me of Pieter Bruegel the Elder and I re-enjoyed his work on the small detour i just took, so thanks-9', '2010-05-12 22:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004905, 880431, 60698, '<td valign="top">Visually striking! Looks like he''s from the future. Top notch!</td>', 'Visually striking! Looks like he''s from the future. Top notch!', '2010-05-12 22:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
