(6004943, 880338, 13688, '<td valign="top">I would have really liked to see this as more of an abstraction with the mountain dead center and the root things as a pattern of dots below it, but not have any one as a focus of attention in the foreground.  the branch does add another texture but it''s more of a distraction for me that i don''t want to be distracted by.</td>', 'I would have really liked to see this as more of an abstraction with the mountain dead center and the root things as a pattern of dots below it, but not have any one as a focus of attention in the foreground.  the branch does add another texture but it''s more of a distraction for me that i don''t want to be distracted by.', '2010-05-12 23:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004954, 878509, 30791, '<td valign="top">I''m seeing her everywhere. Lovely model</td>', 'I''m seeing her everywhere. Lovely model', '2010-05-12 23:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004961, 878657, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice old feeling to your entry.</td>', 'Nice old feeling to your entry.', '2010-05-12 23:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004973, 880270, 57447, '<td valign="top">Nice...simple.</td>', 'Nice...simple.', '2010-05-12 23:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004976, 878770, 57447, '<td valign="top">I love seeing balloons over water.</td>', 'I love seeing balloons over water.', '2010-05-12 23:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004986, 878866, 13688, '<td valign="top">cool treatment.  i like the balance of the blues and the yellows.  to be a critiquer... if you were going for graphic quality, i would have removed that green wall and green splotch in the middle by blending them into a bluer background color.  if you weren''t going for pure graphic aesthetic, i suppose i would need more of the environment to begin to feel closer to  character of agnes</td>', 'cool treatment.  i like the balance of the blues and the yellows.  to be a critiquer... if you were going for graphic quality, i would have removed that green wall and green splotch in the middle by blending them into a bluer background color.  if you weren''t going for pure graphic aesthetic, i suppose i would need more of the environment to begin to feel closer to  character of agnes', '2010-05-12 23:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004988, 880512, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2010-05-12 23:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6004991, 879067, 30791, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! Great work on everyone involved</td>', 'Fantastic! Great work on everyone involved', '2010-05-12 23:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
