(6005085, 878927, 104841, '<td valign="top">while it appears to be a nice sunset it is not very exciting due the the bland sky and I find the tree branches here to be a distraction. I also feel that it is not as sharp as I could be, did you hand hold this?</td>', 'while it appears to be a nice sunset it is not very exciting due the the bland sky and I find the tree branches here to be a distraction. I also feel that it is not as sharp as I could be, did you hand hold this?', '2010-05-13 00:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
