(6005600, 880337, 35545, '<td valign="top">Great colors and composition.  Great geometry.  I like the contrast of the round tire and the square window.</td>', 'Great colors and composition.  Great geometry.  I like the contrast of the round tire and the square window.', '2010-05-13 10:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
