(6005605, 880097, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good shot that captures the mood well.  IMNSHO, you should crop out the the heavy part of the window at the top.  That dark horizontal line distracts from the moody scene at the bottom.</td>', 'Good shot that captures the mood well.  IMNSHO, you should crop out the the heavy part of the window at the top.  That dark horizontal line distracts from the moody scene at the bottom.', '2010-05-13 10:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005621, 879540, 50011, '<td valign="top">Ha, ha so cool. Nice shot.</td>', 'Ha, ha so cool. Nice shot.', '2010-05-13 11:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005642, 880075, 50011, '<td valign="top">Almost like Sin City. Nice colors.</td>', 'Almost like Sin City. Nice colors.', '2010-05-13 11:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005671, 879864, 93756, '<td valign="top">Love the color tones here. It might seem picky but the leading lines lead to...a little red sign. You could have cloned that out in advanced editing, right? Sorry, it just mars your otherwise lovely photo.</td>', 'Love the color tones here. It might seem picky but the leading lines lead to...a little red sign. You could have cloned that out in advanced editing, right? Sorry, it just mars your otherwise lovely photo.', '2010-05-13 11:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005674, 880347, 93756, '<td valign="top">I think you could have cropped to the top of the sofa and eliminated the visual clutter of the drapes. Need more detail in the pants. Very nice and crisp focus on the model. You''ve made her complexion smooth and lovely. Maybe a little greenish to the tint?</td>', 'I think you could have cropped to the top of the sofa and eliminated the visual clutter of the drapes. Need more detail in the pants. Very nice and crisp focus on the model. You''ve made her complexion smooth and lovely. Maybe a little greenish to the tint?', '2010-05-13 11:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005676, 880525, 93756, '<td valign="top">I don''t think black &amp; white does this justice - it gives us too much grey sky. Might have been more interesting if the man had the pole in his hands too. Good capture of the waves crashing - it''s just that part is lost in the darkness.</td>', 'I don''t think black & white does this justice - it gives us too much grey sky. Might have been more interesting if the man had the pole in his hands too. Good capture of the waves crashing - it''s just that part is lost in the darkness.', '2010-05-13 11:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005678, 880030, 93756, '<td valign="top">Nothing really leaps out as the focal point. The group blends in with the rocks so much that it just doesn''t grab me.</td>', 'Nothing really leaps out as the focal point. The group blends in with the rocks so much that it just doesn''t grab me.', '2010-05-13 12:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005681, 879562, 93756, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful. Love the unexpected centered composition.</td>', 'Really beautiful. Love the unexpected centered composition.', '2010-05-13 12:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005685, 878618, 93756, '<td valign="top">Great looking sky and skyline. Wonderful color and very clear. <br/>Tiny nit: a 1/4 inch more at the top and you wouldn''t have the awkward cutoff of the foreground building.</td>', 'Great looking sky and skyline. Wonderful color and very clear. Tiny nit: a 1/4 inch more at the top and you wouldn''t have the awkward cutoff of the foreground building.', '2010-05-13 12:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005691, 879499, 93756, '<td valign="top">Not usually a fan of overly saturated grass but this I love because it gives it an unreal quality like a fairy tale scene. Maybe less of the sky would help even more to fill the frame with the yellow/greens. Love how the color of the horse is repeated in the barn.</td>', 'Not usually a fan of overly saturated grass but this I love because it gives it an unreal quality like a fairy tale scene. Maybe less of the sky would help even more to fill the frame with the yellow/greens. Love how the color of the horse is repeated in the barn.', '2010-05-13 12:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005695, 878996, 93756, '<td valign="top">Wow, the level of detail you captured is amazing. Can''t wait to see your lens zoom to find out what lens I need to buy. Great light in his eyes. Perfect color.</td>', 'Wow, the level of detail you captured is amazing. Can''t wait to see your lens zoom to find out what lens I need to buy. Great light in his eyes. Perfect color.', '2010-05-13 12:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
