(6006741, 880330, 75618, '<td valign="top">~Like a rollin'' thunder chasing the wind<br/>Forces pullin'' from the center of the earth again<br/>I can feel it~<br/> <br/>I''m assuming you''re referring to that song. =) Picture is a little busy but nice catch. 7</td>', '~Like a rollin'' thunder chasing the windForces pullin'' from the center of the earth againI can feel it~ I''m assuming you''re referring to that song. =) Picture is a little busy but nice catch. 7', '2010-05-14 04:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
