(6006748, 878505, 75618, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t quite capture the magic of your balloon challenge entry but it''s still a great shot with beautiful colors and shapes. I think cropping/cloning out the houses and powerlines would have improved this picture. 7</td>', 'This doesn''t quite capture the magic of your balloon challenge entry but it''s still a great shot with beautiful colors and shapes. I think cropping/cloning out the houses and powerlines would have improved this picture. 7', '2010-05-14 04:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
