(6006959, 878614, 70078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and overall very smooth, but I feel its lacking an interesting foreground. Still very good!</td>', 'Beautiful sky and overall very smooth, but I feel its lacking an interesting foreground. Still very good!', '2010-05-14 10:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
