(6006963, 880421, 70078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, textbook really :) Personally I would prefer a bit more sharpness and contrast, or at least some "oomph".</td>', 'Beautiful composition, textbook really :) Personally I would prefer a bit more sharpness and contrast, or at least some "oomph".', '2010-05-14 10:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6006967, 878695, 70078, '<td valign="top">Nice splash/break but I feel like the horizon is leaning to the left.. Maybe just me. The texture is also bothering me for some reason - maybe because it looks like your clarity slider slid a bit too far, but also, just me :)</td>', 'Nice splash/break but I feel like the horizon is leaning to the left.. Maybe just me. The texture is also bothering me for some reason - maybe because it looks like your clarity slider slid a bit too far, but also, just me :)', '2010-05-14 10:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
