(6006975, 878670, 70078, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot, the little red..  uhm thing? on the cowboy to the right is a tiny bit distracting though. Absolutely a hidden gem IMO! 8 :)</td>', 'Very cool shot, the little red..  uhm thing? on the cowboy to the right is a tiny bit distracting though. Absolutely a hidden gem IMO! 8 :)', '2010-05-14 11:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
