(6007034, 880097, 70078, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t like pictures like these, but it has such a cosy, vintage feel.. I like the calmness and the noise, be it rain on the glass or image grain.. But does it lean to the left? :-S</td>', 'I normally don''t like pictures like these, but it has such a cosy, vintage feel.. I like the calmness and the noise, be it rain on the glass or image grain.. But does it lean to the left? :-S', '2010-05-14 11:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007038, 878988, 70078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, the moment, composition, crop, colours! Oh and the bird too ;) I would like the head to be a bit sharper, but still lovely!</td>', 'Beautiful, the moment, composition, crop, colours! Oh and the bird too ;) I would like the head to be a bit sharper, but still lovely!', '2010-05-14 11:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
