(6007049, 879013, 70078, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just my calibration (or perhaps lack there of) but I think the center of the flower is too bright. Also, too tightly cropped, but overall very nice :)</td>', 'Maybe it''s just my calibration (or perhaps lack there of) but I think the center of the flower is too bright. Also, too tightly cropped, but overall very nice :)', '2010-05-14 11:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
