(6007972, 880186, 101668, '<td valign="top">what a lucky catch! Great eye and I love the water reflecting on its belly. Good job</td>', 'what a lucky catch! Great eye and I love the water reflecting on its belly. Good job', '2010-05-15 07:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007976, 879332, 101668, '<td valign="top">Ain''t rocks just wonderful. I see the sleeping man and I see the dog of Neverending story and in the front a young African guy holding head above water! Great photography too! The colours are unreal and the water "dreamy"</td>', 'Ain''t rocks just wonderful. I see the sleeping man and I see the dog of Neverending story and in the front a young African guy holding head above water! Great photography too! The colours are unreal and the water "dreamy"', '2010-05-15 07:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007977, 878571, 101668, '<td valign="top">Amazing angle and colours.</td>', 'Amazing angle and colours.', '2010-05-15 07:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007981, 879832, 101668, '<td valign="top">So, so sweet.</td>', 'So, so sweet.', '2010-05-15 07:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007982, 878809, 70078, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and technically very good. I''m not thrilled about the diagonal here but it''s a good shot none the less. Cool horse, beautiful sky (maybe a bit oversaturated though?), but not much wow factor. 7 :)</td>', 'Nice composition and technically very good. I''m not thrilled about the diagonal here but it''s a good shot none the less. Cool horse, beautiful sky (maybe a bit oversaturated though?), but not much wow factor. 7 :)', '2010-05-15 07:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007983, 880342, 70078, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky, but for me the composition could be better and the poles straighter. Still very nice to look at :)</td>', 'Gorgeous sky, but for me the composition could be better and the poles straighter. Still very nice to look at :)', '2010-05-15 07:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007984, 879889, 70078, '<td valign="top">Nice, the horizon is a bit centered though, I would have liked a little less sky and a bit more foreground.</td>', 'Nice, the horizon is a bit centered though, I would have liked a little less sky and a bit more foreground.', '2010-05-15 07:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007985, 880318, 101668, '<td valign="top">Pity the light at the bottom is a bit harsh it spoils a wonderful picture just enough for me not to vote a ten. Reaaalllyy great.</td>', 'Pity the light at the bottom is a bit harsh it spoils a wonderful picture just enough for me not to vote a ten. Reaaalllyy great.', '2010-05-15 07:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007986, 878891, 70078, '<td valign="top">Ooh, mysterious! This would look good on canvas, I think :)</td>', 'Ooh, mysterious! This would look good on canvas, I think :)', '2010-05-15 07:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007987, 880044, 70078, '<td valign="top">If this was a night shot I would like it so much better. Technically good, but doesn''t really leave anything behind. Also not crazy about the vignette, whether it''s post-crop or not.</td>', 'If this was a night shot I would like it so much better. Technically good, but doesn''t really leave anything behind. Also not crazy about the vignette, whether it''s post-crop or not.', '2010-05-15 07:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007988, 880030, 61396, '<td valign="top">The rocky shapes and the monkeys merge together nicely to form a single texture. (not voting)</td>', 'The rocky shapes and the monkeys merge together nicely to form a single texture. (not voting)', '2010-05-15 07:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007990, 880055, 101668, '<td valign="top">Lovely flower but it is as if not sharp. Intentional?</td>', 'Lovely flower but it is as if not sharp. Intentional?', '2010-05-15 07:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007991, 879090, 101668, '<td valign="top">Very difficult picture, I think. Well done though</td>', 'Very difficult picture, I think. Well done though', '2010-05-15 07:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007992, 880004, 70078, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I feel like it''s leaning slightly to the left.</td>', 'I like this, but I feel like it''s leaning slightly to the left.', '2010-05-15 07:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007993, 880143, 70078, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the border and I would have liked to see more foreground instead of the white. Also the sky is a bit too turquoise for me. Still a nice shot, smart composition and obviously a beautiful town.</td>', 'I don''t like the border and I would have liked to see more foreground instead of the white. Also the sky is a bit too turquoise for me. Still a nice shot, smart composition and obviously a beautiful town.', '2010-05-15 07:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007997, 878516, 70078, '<td valign="top">Lovely bird and scene altogether, but I have a feeling the focus wasn''t spot on to begin with so the sharpening had to do the trick. Maybe just me :) Another thing that jumps at me, red chromatic aberration on the bottom flower. Still a very nice shot, so a 7 :)</td>', 'Lovely bird and scene altogether, but I have a feeling the focus wasn''t spot on to begin with so the sharpening had to do the trick. Maybe just me :) Another thing that jumps at me, red chromatic aberration on the bottom flower. Still a very nice shot, so a 7 :)', '2010-05-15 07:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007998, 880092, 70078, '<td valign="top">and sadly they never will.. Although the message is good, I''m not liking the picture as much as I want to. It''s not messy enough to be messy and obviously it''s not neat. The black and white processing also isn''t spot on, I think the bag is too bright and the can too dark. Good idea though :)</td>', 'and sadly they never will.. Although the message is good, I''m not liking the picture as much as I want to. It''s not messy enough to be messy and obviously it''s not neat. The black and white processing also isn''t spot on, I think the bag is too bright and the can too dark. Good idea though :)', '2010-05-15 07:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008000, 879808, 70078, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, beautifully exposed. Maybe it would look even better in a harsh b&amp;w? And I mean <b>harsh and contrasty</b>. Still, I like!</td>', 'Nice composition, beautifully exposed. Maybe it would look even better in a harsh b&w? And I mean harsh and contrasty. Still, I like!', '2010-05-15 07:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008003, 879881, 70078, '<td valign="top">Oh wow. I don''t understand at all what is happening or whether this has been rotated so he''s not head-down.. but wow. The framing, lighting, processing.. wow. Couldn''t be better! If it can, please show me so I can be "wow"ed again?</td>', 'Oh wow. I don''t understand at all what is happening or whether this has been rotated so he''s not head-down.. but wow. The framing, lighting, processing.. wow. Couldn''t be better! If it can, please show me so I can be "wow"ed again?', '2010-05-15 07:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008004, 880221, 70078, '<td valign="top">Cute sunset.. or sunrise. Still, I''m missing something to look at, some silhouette or something in the foreground.</td>', 'Cute sunset.. or sunrise. Still, I''m missing something to look at, some silhouette or something in the foreground.', '2010-05-15 08:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008006, 878955, 70078, '<td valign="top">Cool. I''m sure this would do better in a themed challenge, but this is a really nice picture. Something to put on a wall. Would give this a 10 if I could lock my eyes somewhere, but a very high 9 from me! :)</td>', 'Cool. I''m sure this would do better in a themed challenge, but this is a really nice picture. Something to put on a wall. Would give this a 10 if I could lock my eyes somewhere, but a very high 9 from me! :)', '2010-05-15 08:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008008, 879939, 70078, '<td valign="top">For my part, the white center is to big here. Nice macro and composition though and lovely colours and texture.</td>', 'For my part, the white center is to big here. Nice macro and composition though and lovely colours and texture.', '2010-05-15 08:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008009, 880239, 70078, '<td valign="top">This looks like something out of a science magazine. Very cool and the bokeh is wonderful. I''m sure it''s even better bigger when the details can be seen without warming one''s nose on the computer screen ;o)</td>', 'This looks like something out of a science magazine. Very cool and the bokeh is wonderful. I''m sure it''s even better bigger when the details can be seen without warming one''s nose on the computer screen ;o)', '2010-05-15 08:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008010, 879126, 70078, '<td valign="top">This is great! Classic, but original because of the angle. A 10 in my books, hope more books are like mine ;o)</td>', 'This is great! Classic, but original because of the angle. A 10 in my books, hope more books are like mine ;o)', '2010-05-15 08:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008012, 878497, 70078, '<td valign="top">Nice scene and composition, but I''d like the railtracks to start in both bottom corners. Also, the sharpening halo around the trees bothers me. Aside from that, very good!</td>', 'Nice scene and composition, but I''d like the railtracks to start in both bottom corners. Also, the sharpening halo around the trees bothers me. Aside from that, very good!', '2010-05-15 08:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008013, 880444, 70078, '<td valign="top">The skin blur could be better. The line on the neck is too much of an eye-catcher and for my part there is too much blurring. It is on the other hand well done, the composition is comfortable and the DOF is lovely.</td>', 'The skin blur could be better. The line on the neck is too much of an eye-catcher and for my part there is too much blurring. It is on the other hand well done, the composition is comfortable and the DOF is lovely.', '2010-05-15 08:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008015, 879986, 70078, '<td valign="top">Composition is good.. I like pictures with faces showing better.</td>', 'Composition is good.. I like pictures with faces showing better.', '2010-05-15 08:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008017, 879301, 70078, '<td valign="top">Cute! I find the small lock of hair over the face disturbing a very beautiful portrait.</td>', 'Cute! I find the small lock of hair over the face disturbing a very beautiful portrait.', '2010-05-15 08:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008018, 879617, 70078, '<td valign="top">Lovely! Makes me want to go fishing. 8 :)</td>', 'Lovely! Makes me want to go fishing. 8 :)', '2010-05-15 08:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008019, 878773, 70078, '<td valign="top">Everything is very nice about this picture except (I''m a nitpicker) I think it is cropped too close to the flower on the right. Aside from that, lovely!</td>', 'Everything is very nice about this picture except (I''m a nitpicker) I think it is cropped too close to the flower on the right. Aside from that, lovely!', '2010-05-15 08:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008021, 880225, 70078, '<td valign="top">Ooh. Indeed! This is stunning. Hmm.. Volcano ash cloud sunset in Iceland? Postcard material! (a compliment from me, if you''re in doubt :P). 10</td>', 'Ooh. Indeed! This is stunning. Hmm.. Volcano ash cloud sunset in Iceland? Postcard material! (a compliment from me, if you''re in doubt :P). 10', '2010-05-15 08:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008023, 880483, 70078, '<td valign="top">I like this, the composition and the short DOF. I would like the lizard to pop a bit more though.. NB, just a <i>bit</i> :) A very high 8!</td>', 'I like this, the composition and the short DOF. I would like the lizard to pop a bit more though.. NB, just a bit :) A very high 8!', '2010-05-15 08:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008025, 880459, 70078, '<td valign="top">The sharpening halo bothers me. Also that the skaters in the background are headless. Still, technically well done and a good idea.. just not my cup of tea :)</td>', 'The sharpening halo bothers me. Also that the skaters in the background are headless. Still, technically well done and a good idea.. just not my cup of tea :)', '2010-05-15 08:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008026, 880397, 70078, '<td valign="top">How adorable! "stop spying on me, you giant!" :) I know how difficult it is to get this kind of shot, so a 10 from me ;)</td>', 'How adorable! "stop spying on me, you giant!" :) I know how difficult it is to get this kind of shot, so a 10 from me ;)', '2010-05-15 08:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008028, 880312, 70078, '<td valign="top">I have a thing with cropping: either crop way tight or give enough room for everything to breath. I don''t know how this flower is supposed to look, but it looks slightly off to me. It needs more pop.. and more sharpness.</td>', 'I have a thing with cropping: either crop way tight or give enough room for everything to breath. I don''t know how this flower is supposed to look, but it looks slightly off to me. It needs more pop.. and more sharpness.', '2010-05-15 08:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008029, 878989, 70078, '<td valign="top">Where is this Horse Country and how do I get there? :)<br/>A nice, mysterious B&amp;W, I think the sky is a bit overexposed.. I''m a nitpicker, my sincerest apologies!</td>', 'Where is this Horse Country and how do I get there? :)A nice, mysterious B&W, I think the sky is a bit overexposed.. I''m a nitpicker, my sincerest apologies!', '2010-05-15 08:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008031, 878549, 70078, '<td valign="top">Ó halló sæti! Awkward if you''re not Icelandic, but hey. This is a very lovely winter portrait of a very lovely Icelandic horse. The blue sky is what makes this a 10 instead of a 9 from me :)</td>', 'Ó halló sæti! Awkward if you''re not Icelandic, but hey. This is a very lovely winter portrait of a very lovely Icelandic horse. The blue sky is what makes this a 10 instead of a 9 from me :)', '2010-05-15 08:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008033, 879784, 70078, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide what I think of this one. I do find the blue a bit distracting though. Very well done though, despite my indecisiveness! ;)</td>', 'I can''t decide what I think of this one. I do find the blue a bit distracting though. Very well done though, despite my indecisiveness! ;)', '2010-05-15 08:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008036, 880504, 96881, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this works so well.  The processing is great here.  Love the effect you have through this and the use of the B&amp;W presentation</td>', 'The simplicity of this works so well.  The processing is great here.  Love the effect you have through this and the use of the B&W presentation', '2010-05-15 08:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008037, 880490, 70078, '<td valign="top">IMO the cityline is too centered. If there had been something going on in the sky to reflect in the water then this much sky and water would have worked for me. Still a nice, clean, classic nightshot, so a 7 :)</td>', 'IMO the cityline is too centered. If there had been something going on in the sky to reflect in the water then this much sky and water would have worked for me. Still a nice, clean, classic nightshot, so a 7 :)', '2010-05-15 08:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008038, 879496, 96881, '<td valign="top">The colours through the background here rocks..........However the buildings do look overexposed to me here.  A great image though</td>', 'The colours through the background here rocks..........However the buildings do look overexposed to me here.  A great image though', '2010-05-15 08:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008039, 880075, 96881, '<td valign="top">Brilliant....Love the sky effects here are amazing.  The framing with the building to the left is great here as is the bridge leading through the image.......</td>', 'Brilliant....Love the sky effects here are amazing.  The framing with the building to the left is great here as is the bridge leading through the image.......', '2010-05-15 08:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008041, 879840, 101668, '<td valign="top">A wonderful place and pic. Well done</td>', 'A wonderful place and pic. Well done', '2010-05-15 08:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008042, 878757, 70078, '<td valign="top">I''m missing a focal point.. or a hidden gem! (har har.. sorry for the bad humor, it''s early on a Saturday morning)<br/>Technically very good though.</td>', 'I''m missing a focal point.. or a hidden gem! (har har.. sorry for the bad humor, it''s early on a Saturday morning)Technically very good though.', '2010-05-15 08:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6008044, 879680, 70078, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t do anything for me.. Why is the sky black? =S</td>', 'This doesn''t do anything for me.. Why is the sky black? =S', '2010-05-15 08:59:22.000000', NULL, 1);
