(6008419, 880184, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s a strange title, for me: I see this work of art as depicting Icarus falling to his death, conflated with Christ crucified (the pose), and for me this does NOT denote "freedom" in any way. I suppose one''s mileage could differ. In any event, I do not deduct for what I consider inapt titles, although I sometimes bonus for excellent ones.</td>', 'That''s a strange title, for me: I see this work of art as depicting Icarus falling to his death, conflated with Christ crucified (the pose), and for me this does NOT denote "freedom" in any way. I suppose one''s mileage could differ. In any event, I do not deduct for what I consider inapt titles, although I sometimes bonus for excellent ones.', '2010-05-15 16:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
