(6008621, 878697, 72670, '<td valign="top">njsabs? nicely lit! I am sure it is scoring well. THere was a time when I marveled at the eye processing here on this site, but now I have grown to dislike the obvious pimping. The whites are too white and the outlining of the pupil is too obvious. I have no problems with enhancing features, just less is more..for me.(maybe that''s why my portraits don''t score as well)</td>', 'njsabs? nicely lit! I am sure it is scoring well. THere was a time when I marveled at the eye processing here on this site, but now I have grown to dislike the obvious pimping. The whites are too white and the outlining of the pupil is too obvious. I have no problems with enhancing features, just less is more..for me.(maybe that''s why my portraits don''t score as well)', '2010-05-15 21:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
