(6008732, 878988, 18367, '<td valign="top">I have an appreciation on just how difficult it is to get one of these images.  This is an outstanding capture and contains all of the attributes one could possibly hope for. The DOF, focus, aperture and lighting are absolutely spot on.  I rarely dole out a 10 score, but this beauty truly warrants such a score.  Good luck with the challenge.<br/> <br/>This is definitely going into my "Favourites" list as soon as the challenge is over.</td>', 'I have an appreciation on just how difficult it is to get one of these images.  This is an outstanding capture and contains all of the attributes one could possibly hope for. The DOF, focus, aperture and lighting are absolutely spot on.  I rarely dole out a 10 score, but this beauty truly warrants such a score.  Good luck with the challenge. This is definitely going into my "Favourites" list as soon as the challenge is over.', '2010-05-15 23:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
