(6009125, 880092, 104841, '<td valign="top">interesting subject matter I think that you should would work better in a collection of shots then a stand alone image.  I don''t think that the composition is there to make it a strong mono image and it looks like you were shooting in rather bright light, making it hard to expose the shot correctly.</td>', 'interesting subject matter I think that you should would work better in a collection of shots then a stand alone image.  I don''t think that the composition is there to make it a strong mono image and it looks like you were shooting in rather bright light, making it hard to expose the shot correctly.', '2010-05-16 12:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009127, 879939, 104841, '<td valign="top">not 100% certain how you lit this shot, but it it was with a flash I think you needed to use it off camera and slightly further away to avoid all of the little white highlights.</td>', 'not 100% certain how you lit this shot, but it it was with a flash I think you needed to use it off camera and slightly further away to avoid all of the little white highlights.', '2010-05-16 12:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009131, 880238, 87316, '<td valign="top">I take shots like this all the time. <br/>Try to have a sense of place in the scene: a famous landmark or interesting place.<br/>Get a seat in front of the wing.  The jet wash blurs the heck out of photos<br/>Puffy clouds in the sky are always good<br/>make sure the focus isn''t on the wing but the landscape<br/>I like the perlesent finish on the wing,</td>', 'I take shots like this all the time. Try to have a sense of place in the scene: a famous landmark or interesting place.Get a seat in front of the wing.  The jet wash blurs the heck out of photosPuffy clouds in the sky are always goodmake sure the focus isn''t on the wing but the landscapeI like the perlesent finish on the wing,', '2010-05-16 12:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009132, 878692, 104841, '<td valign="top">composition is fine, your flower is looking rather flat as it has lost all of its texture, using some less intense light should help that.</td>', 'composition is fine, your flower is looking rather flat as it has lost all of its texture, using some less intense light should help that.', '2010-05-16 12:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
