(6009271, 880178, 70078, '<td valign="top">Ooh, dreamy! Would give this a 10 if the grass on the left wasn''t in the shot, I find it distracting, so a high 9 it is :)</td>', 'Ooh, dreamy! Would give this a 10 if the grass on the left wasn''t in the shot, I find it distracting, so a high 9 it is :)', '2010-05-16 14:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009272, 880100, 70078, '<td valign="top">A bit centered IMO, but a great animal portrait none the less :)</td>', 'A bit centered IMO, but a great animal portrait none the less :)', '2010-05-16 14:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009378, 879936, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but this is really oversharpened. There are definite halos especially in the branches.</td>', 'Nice shot but this is really oversharpened. There are definite halos especially in the branches.', '2010-05-16 15:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009380, 878452, 66515, '<td valign="top">Wow...amazing capture. Nice composition. Great use of high shutter speed. Colors are vibrant without being oversaturated.</td>', 'Wow...amazing capture. Nice composition. Great use of high shutter speed. Colors are vibrant without being oversaturated.', '2010-05-16 15:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009477, 879936, 115791, '<td valign="top">There is an irritating halo on both of the birds, and a little to much clarity, otherwise its nice.</td>', 'There is an irritating halo on both of the birds, and a little to much clarity, otherwise its nice.', '2010-05-16 17:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009494, 880322, 13688, '<td valign="top">in a set shot you are responsible, in my mind, for needing to get every detail under your control.  you need to be aware of the contrast of that stick and the shadow falling on her as they both feel unintended and don''t help strengthen your  composition-8</td>', 'in a set shot you are responsible, in my mind, for needing to get every detail under your control.  you need to be aware of the contrast of that stick and the shadow falling on her as they both feel unintended and don''t help strengthen your  composition-8', '2010-05-16 18:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009497, 880186, 13688, '<td valign="top">yes the bird appears to be very curious about the statue.  i like how the statue has its own aloof personality by facing away and appearing to ignore the inquisitiveness of the bird. -9</td>', 'yes the bird appears to be very curious about the statue.  i like how the statue has its own aloof personality by facing away and appearing to ignore the inquisitiveness of the bird. -9', '2010-05-16 18:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009498, 879229, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice focus.  i wish the riders didn''t overlap-8</td>', 'nice focus.  i wish the riders didn''t overlap-8', '2010-05-16 18:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009504, 879936, 13688, '<td valign="top">dramatic capture.  at first i thought it was too bad you lost the wing, and that it hurt the overall composition.  but perhaps it does well to mimic the continuation of the tree.    a bit over-sharpened as the edges are haloing for me. and i''ve decided to go with too bad you lost the wing ;) -8</td>', 'dramatic capture.  at first i thought it was too bad you lost the wing, and that it hurt the overall composition.  but perhaps it does well to mimic the continuation of the tree.    a bit over-sharpened as the edges are haloing for me. and i''ve decided to go with too bad you lost the wing ;) -8', '2010-05-16 18:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009509, 880004, 13688, '<td valign="top">aptly titled.  i like the negative space, but i also wish i could see more details in the building-8</td>', 'aptly titled.  i like the negative space, but i also wish i could see more details in the building-8', '2010-05-16 18:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009517, 880363, 13688, '<td valign="top">you''ve done such a good job of concealing the background, she looks cut out...perhaps that''s the effect you were going for.  -8</td>', 'you''ve done such a good job of concealing the background, she looks cut out...perhaps that''s the effect you were going for.  -8', '2010-05-16 18:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009523, 880225, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice image.  i bet this looks better, the larger it gets.  i''m a bit surprised you didn''t go for the over used cinematic border...in your case, i think it might have provided a nice balance to the black of the foreground.-9</td>', 'nice image.  i bet this looks better, the larger it gets.  i''m a bit surprised you didn''t go for the over used cinematic border...in your case, i think it might have provided a nice balance to the black of the foreground.-9', '2010-05-16 18:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009525, 879067, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice portrait.  i might have been inclined to crop it just below the bracelet.-8</td>', 'nice portrait.  i might have been inclined to crop it just below the bracelet.-8', '2010-05-16 18:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009535, 880521, 13688, '<td valign="top">this feels really well set up to me.  The removal of the background and the look back of the horse and the excellent lighting.  rule of thirds seems all good.   something is missing for me though...I wish I got more personality of the horse from it.-8</td>', 'this feels really well set up to me.  The removal of the background and the look back of the horse and the excellent lighting.  rule of thirds seems all good.   something is missing for me though...I wish I got more personality of the horse from it.-8', '2010-05-16 18:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009540, 880353, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice lighting...reminded me of Vermeer lighting-9</td>', 'nice lighting...reminded me of Vermeer lighting-9', '2010-05-16 18:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009548, 879964, 13688, '<td valign="top">i just saw the "blue eyes" photo before this one, and i think you should take a look for it.  perhaps you could benefit with some more lighting from the right to lessen the strength of the shadow on her nose as i don''t believe most would find it flattering for the type of portrait you appear to be shooting for -8</td>', 'i just saw the "blue eyes" photo before this one, and i think you should take a look for it.  perhaps you could benefit with some more lighting from the right to lessen the strength of the shadow on her nose as i don''t believe most would find it flattering for the type of portrait you appear to be shooting for -8', '2010-05-16 18:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009559, 879564, 13688, '<td valign="top">the destination of your leading line is very intriguing...i wish whatever it is, was a bit more prominent.-8</td>', 'the destination of your leading line is very intriguing...i wish whatever it is, was a bit more prominent.-8', '2010-05-16 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009569, 879013, 13688, '<td valign="top">something feels awkward for me with the unfocused petal running directly across the over-sharpened stamen.  But believe me I am not a professional at coming up with creative looking flower shots :( as witnessed back in the day here:<br/> <br/>//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=97293<br/> <br/> <br/>-8</td>', 'something feels awkward for me with the unfocused petal running directly across the over-sharpened stamen.  But believe me I am not a professional at coming up with creative looking flower shots :( as witnessed back in the day here: //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=97293  -8', '2010-05-16 19:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009574, 880044, 13688, '<td valign="top">it looks like someone threw a snugglie over the building at the bottom.  your contrast is nice, your focus is crisp, your processing makes the lighting look flatter than it probably was so i suppose that was your intent.-8</td>', 'it looks like someone threw a snugglie over the building at the bottom.  your contrast is nice, your focus is crisp, your processing makes the lighting look flatter than it probably was so i suppose that was your intent.-8', '2010-05-16 19:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009580, 879310, 13688, '<td valign="top">technicals of the photo are nice.  the long angle doesn''t really give a feel of distance as it appears he just barely reached the sand.  If i were the long jumper i would most likely want to be captured soaring through the air...luckily i''m just a lame commenter at dpchallenge.-8</td>', 'technicals of the photo are nice.  the long angle doesn''t really give a feel of distance as it appears he just barely reached the sand.  If i were the long jumper i would most likely want to be captured soaring through the air...luckily i''m just a lame commenter at dpchallenge.-8', '2010-05-16 19:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009583, 879410, 13688, '<td valign="top">b/w works really well for this photo.  not sure why there is so much space above the fedora.-8</td>', 'b/w works really well for this photo.  not sure why there is so much space above the fedora.-8', '2010-05-16 19:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009589, 880341, 13688, '<td valign="top">good night shot.  i like how the moon came out in the tree.  i don''t like the bridge as it is peeking into the upper right.  i might have tried to step back and incorporate more of the bridge to fully frame the hotel if possible.-8</td>', 'good night shot.  i like how the moon came out in the tree.  i don''t like the bridge as it is peeking into the upper right.  i might have tried to step back and incorporate more of the bridge to fully frame the hotel if possible.-8', '2010-05-16 19:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009595, 879108, 13688, '<td valign="top">almost feels like you got him to sit for the shot. those are some sad eyes for a tiger...i guess the russians are pretty stingy with their meat.-8</td>', 'almost feels like you got him to sit for the shot. those are some sad eyes for a tiger...i guess the russians are pretty stingy with their meat.-8', '2010-05-16 19:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009603, 880480, 13688, '<td valign="top">...Whether ''tis nobler in the focus to blur -8</td>', '...Whether ''tis nobler in the focus to blur -8', '2010-05-16 19:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009620, 880030, 13688, '<td valign="top">i never really paid attention to a monkeys tail until your image.  they seem shorter than i previously thought -8</td>', 'i never really paid attention to a monkeys tail until your image.  they seem shorter than i previously thought -8', '2010-05-16 19:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009633, 879149, 13688, '<td valign="top">yes...very intense...so a good capture.  I''m definitely not a lighting expert, but i think you should have exposed for the tan or just upped the mid levels, as is it feels a bit dark. focus needs to be tighter to score better.-8</td>', 'yes...very intense...so a good capture.  I''m definitely not a lighting expert, but i think you should have exposed for the tan or just upped the mid levels, as is it feels a bit dark. focus needs to be tighter to score better.-8', '2010-05-16 19:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009641, 880457, 13688, '<td valign="top">you don''t need a studio for a nice portrait, but you need a background that is a bit less distracting.  i think this was a nice choice for b/w with the way the light is hitting her lapels.-8</td>', 'you don''t need a studio for a nice portrait, but you need a background that is a bit less distracting.  i think this was a nice choice for b/w with the way the light is hitting her lapels.-8', '2010-05-16 19:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009650, 880019, 13688, '<td valign="top">you lighting feels unnatural but i don''t mind.  i wish your foreground was more interesting-8</td>', 'you lighting feels unnatural but i don''t mind.  i wish your foreground was more interesting-8', '2010-05-16 19:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6009666, 878892, 75713, '<td valign="top">For some reason this shot tickled my funny bone.  Actually the expressions on the faces of the ppl did.  I really like the angle and the uniqueness of this photo - stands out from the crowd.</td>', 'For some reason this shot tickled my funny bone.  Actually the expressions on the faces of the ppl did.  I really like the angle and the uniqueness of this photo - stands out from the crowd.', '2010-05-16 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
