(6009995, 880196, 13688, '<td valign="top">it took me a second to get the smile reference...maybe it would have been more apparent for slow folks like myself if all of the frowns were uncut. i''m left wondering if that quick drop off of focus  could have been done outside of photoshop...and i''m afraid i don''t know...that means the circle of confusion is still very confusing to me-9</td>', 'it took me a second to get the smile reference...maybe it would have been more apparent for slow folks like myself if all of the frowns were uncut. i''m left wondering if that quick drop off of focus  could have been done outside of photoshop...and i''m afraid i don''t know...that means the circle of confusion is still very confusing to me-9', '2010-05-16 22:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
