(6010021, 880415, 18367, '<td valign="top">A stunningly beautiful image that just screams "Post Card".  Having had the opportunity to take oodles of photos with snow, I have a full appreciation as to just how difficult it is to pull off, and you have done a wonderful job of it.<br/> <br/>I can assure you that this will go into my favorites list immediately after the challenge.  Very nicely done indeed.</td>', 'A stunningly beautiful image that just screams "Post Card".  Having had the opportunity to take oodles of photos with snow, I have a full appreciation as to just how difficult it is to pull off, and you have done a wonderful job of it. I can assure you that this will go into my favorites list immediately after the challenge.  Very nicely done indeed.', '2010-05-16 22:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6010027, 880435, 18367, '<td valign="top">Goodness, this bird looks identical to one that visits user]snaffles[/user]feeders.  <br/> <br/>Very nicely done.</td>', 'Goodness, this bird looks identical to one that visits user]snaffles[/user]feeders.   Very nicely done.', '2010-05-16 22:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6010043, 879964, 33392, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this.  The lighting is very nice, and those eyes....</td>', 'I absolutely love this.  The lighting is very nice, and those eyes....', '2010-05-16 23:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6010046, 880397, 33392, '<td valign="top">I would love to know how much of a crop this is.  I have been shooting hummingbirds this spring, and haven''t been able to get close enough to get one this sharp.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'I would love to know how much of a crop this is.  I have been shooting hummingbirds this spring, and haven''t been able to get close enough to get one this sharp. Well done.', '2010-05-16 23:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
