(6010048, 880521, 33392, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2010-05-16 23:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6010111, 878878, 13688, '<td valign="top">yes...you''ve definitely transformed USP into another world...one of mystery and intrigue...i was unfortunately brought back to today''s reality by the Met cap and that damn Swoosh.  excellent contrasts...so a great b/w.  I was going to say something about the letterbox and philosophical merit, and HCB farting dust...but what the hell do i know.  I''m probably just bitter because I''m sitting at a 3.8 in this challenge ;) - 8</td>', 'yes...you''ve definitely transformed USP into another world...one of mystery and intrigue...i was unfortunately brought back to today''s reality by the Met cap and that damn Swoosh.  excellent contrasts...so a great b/w.  I was going to say something about the letterbox and philosophical merit, and HCB farting dust...but what the hell do i know.  I''m probably just bitter because I''m sitting at a 3.8 in this challenge ;) - 8', '2010-05-16 23:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
