(6012441, 878746, 109478, '<td valign="top">The composition is good and I like the bird flying on the wave. <br/>The sky is a little flat and not stormy enough, maybe you can add more contrast on it. It seems that most voters like more dramatic photo. Then, the whole image is a little blur or not sharp enough. I think it adds some poetic mood, but maybe some voter don''t like it.</td>', 'The composition is good and I like the bird flying on the wave. The sky is a little flat and not stormy enough, maybe you can add more contrast on it. It seems that most voters like more dramatic photo. Then, the whole image is a little blur or not sharp enough. I think it adds some poetic mood, but maybe some voter don''t like it.', '2010-05-18 05:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
