(6012476, 880322, 70078, '<td valign="top">Nice, although the curvy thing behind her and the fence is distracting me a bit. Also would have liked highlights on her face rather than body, her face looks fierce!</td>', 'Nice, although the curvy thing behind her and the fence is distracting me a bit. Also would have liked highlights on her face rather than body, her face looks fierce!', '2010-05-18 07:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
