(6014726, 879045, 83313, '<td valign="top">5.54!!???? You got robbed Deb! At gunpoint! This is great! Hmm, I was sure I had faved it during the challenge, but it shows no faves. I''ll fix that.<br/> <br/>This was one of those highly successful entries that did not have the broad appeal for a high average, but totally nailed it for the people who appreciate such stuff. Look at the commenter''s average, <b>8.00!</b> <br/>I think you need to take that apologetic statement off your photographers notes and be proud of this one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-05-19 01:12:30.</i></td>', '5.54!!???? You got robbed Deb! At gunpoint! This is great! Hmm, I was sure I had faved it during the challenge, but it shows no faves. I''ll fix that. This was one of those highly successful entries that did not have the broad appeal for a high average, but totally nailed it for the people who appreciate such stuff. Look at the commenter''s average, 8.00! I think you need to take that apologetic statement off your photographers notes and be proud of this one.', '2010-05-19 02:07:44.000000', '2010-05-19 02:12:30.000000', 0),
