(6014790, 878450, 108580, '<td valign="top">Brad, sucks when you only get two comments for a great shot like this. I couldn''t place which one was yours but knew it was one of the four. Lovely image mate.</td>', 'Brad, sucks when you only get two comments for a great shot like this. I couldn''t place which one was yours but knew it was one of the four. Lovely image mate.', '2010-05-19 02:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
