(6014840, 880419, 44611, '<td valign="top">I totally agree with Maggye here.  I''m not often inspired by portrait photography but this image is wonderful in its vibrancy.  The composition and lighting are good and it is a shame that it didn''t score higher.</td>', 'I totally agree with Maggye here.  I''m not often inspired by portrait photography but this image is wonderful in its vibrancy.  The composition and lighting are good and it is a shame that it didn''t score higher.', '2010-05-19 03:13:35.000000', NULL, 0),
