(6015025, 880344, 67258, '<td valign="top">This was one of the 10s I gave - I absolutely fell in love with it on first viewing, and it continues to grow on me!  Thank you for posting the notes - it seems so appropriate that the girl is pregnant, even though you can''t tell from the photo.</td>', 'This was one of the 10s I gave - I absolutely fell in love with it on first viewing, and it continues to grow on me!  Thank you for posting the notes - it seems so appropriate that the girl is pregnant, even though you can''t tell from the photo.', '2010-05-19 05:00:14.000000', NULL, 0),
