(6018309, 878621, 108580, '<td valign="top">That reflection in the glass also did it for me.<br/>Shot with a KM MF 50mm 1.2! A Rokkor? Best glass manufacturer in it''s day!<br/> <br/>Luckily my XG-M and XD-7 survived as did my 50mm Rokkor f/1.4 and an f/1.7 and the my 70-200mm Rokkor.<br/>The XK and XM, dozens of classic Minolta lenses inc. a Minolta RF Rokkor-X 800mm f8 Mirror, went out the window and over the wall :(<br/> <br/>You have inspired me, I''m off to go take some shots with the XG-M f/1.4 and some 400ASA Fuji</td>', 'That reflection in the glass also did it for me.Shot with a KM MF 50mm 1.2! A Rokkor? Best glass manufacturer in it''s day! Luckily my XG-M and XD-7 survived as did my 50mm Rokkor f/1.4 and an f/1.7 and the my 70-200mm Rokkor.The XK and XM, dozens of classic Minolta lenses inc. a Minolta RF Rokkor-X 800mm f8 Mirror, went out the window and over the wall :( You have inspired me, I''m off to go take some shots with the XG-M f/1.4 and some 400ASA Fuji', '2010-05-20 11:59:47.000000', NULL, 0);
