(6019240, 880385, 77305, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jac:</b></div><hr/><i> As a Canadian I feel obligated to go there and photograph my ass off but I can never find the right time to go, and I''m alone. Maybe late this summer, who knows.<br/> <br/>Great image, love the tonal values in the sky and reflection. Lots of interesting foreground with great leading lines to the majestic mountain range in the background. Congrats.<br/> <br/>What''s the weather like in late August early Sept? Is it too cold at that time? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Any time is a good time! This place is always good for photos. Sunrise especially because beyond those mountains are the foothills and prairies so you get to see the sun sooner then when you''re deep into the mountains.<br/>And define too cold? This shot was taken in January and if I remember correctly...it was around -5?<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Jac: As a Canadian I feel obligated to go there and photograph my ass off but I can never find the right time to go, and I''m alone. Maybe late this summer, who knows. Great image, love the tonal values in the sky and reflection. Lots of interesting foreground with great leading lines to the majestic mountain range in the background. Congrats. What''s the weather like in late August early Sept? Is it too cold at that time?   Any time is a good time! This place is always good for photos. Sunrise especially because beyond those mountains are the foothills and prairies so you get to see the sun sooner then when you''re deep into the mountains.And define too cold? This shot was taken in January and if I remember correctly...it was around -5? ', '2010-05-20 23:05:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6019378, 879045, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm.  I like it, but that border!  Man, what''s with the borders?!?!?  Actually, it suits this picture nicely.  This is a picture that brings a big smile to my face, and I can also smell it, and I love pictures that I can smell.</td>', 'Hmmmm.  I like it, but that border!  Man, what''s with the borders?!?!?  Actually, it suits this picture nicely.  This is a picture that brings a big smile to my face, and I can also smell it, and I love pictures that I can smell.', '2010-05-21 00:43:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6019519, 879751, 68586, '<td valign="top">Love it - full of richness and colour.<br/> <br/>My only question is whether the white at the top of the picture draws the eye away from the main image due to it''s brightness ? Other than that - very nice.</td>', 'Love it - full of richness and colour. My only question is whether the white at the top of the picture draws the eye away from the main image due to it''s brightness ? Other than that - very nice.', '2010-05-21 03:32:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6019521, 880339, 68586, '<td valign="top">This is a really sweet picture - I like the tenderness and gentle feel of it aided by the pastel pallette. Nothing loud - nothing harsh - all the elements contributing towards a feeling of intimacy.<br/> <br/>My only slight wonder is whether the block of white on the right ( presumably the bed ? ) actually is a distraction ? The eye tends to naturally be drawn to bright areas, and can compete for the viewers attention with the main subject.<br/> <br/>Still a very nice shot though</td>', 'This is a really sweet picture - I like the tenderness and gentle feel of it aided by the pastel pallette. Nothing loud - nothing harsh - all the elements contributing towards a feeling of intimacy. My only slight wonder is whether the block of white on the right ( presumably the bed ? ) actually is a distraction ? The eye tends to naturally be drawn to bright areas, and can compete for the viewers attention with the main subject. Still a very nice shot though', '2010-05-21 03:38:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6019528, 880339, 96793, '<td valign="top">@ Jedusi : i know what you mean about the bed. its more obviously a bed when the photo is in its original horizontal orientation. the brightness of it is potentially distracting and would have been better off thought of ahead of time.</td>', '@ Jedusi : i know what you mean about the bed. its more obviously a bed when the photo is in its original horizontal orientation. the brightness of it is potentially distracting and would have been better off thought of ahead of time.', '2010-05-21 03:53:08.000000', NULL, 0),
