(6021806, 879708, 38478, '<td valign="top">I do not understand why this scored so low. I gave it a 7 during voting. It could have handled a bit more DOF (it looks like a red piece of fabric and more DOF could have showed us more of the rose), but that makes the difference between a 7 and an 8, it doesn''t make it a 4.85.</td>', 'I do not understand why this scored so low. I gave it a 7 during voting. It could have handled a bit more DOF (it looks like a red piece of fabric and more DOF could have showed us more of the rose), but that makes the difference between a 7 and an 8, it doesn''t make it a 4.85.', '2010-05-23 11:06:35.000000', NULL, 0),
