(6024567, 880261, 59267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ann:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautifully done. Can you share your lighting setup? 4 lights? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Natural sun light (partly cloudy) was the major light. You can tell from the shutter speed. I used one flash as fill light but it didn''t help that much, due to the shutter speed.</td>', 'Originally posted by Ann: Beautifully done. Can you share your lighting setup? 4 lights?  Natural sun light (partly cloudy) was the major light. You can tell from the shutter speed. I used one flash as fill light but it didn''t help that much, due to the shutter speed.', '2010-05-24 17:39:51.000000', NULL, 0),
