(6042427, 879013, 68947, '<td valign="top">ROFL....MOST things in here have been "beaten to death"!  How many liquid drips, bees, smoke patterns, broken lightbulbs, fireworks, birds, flowers, zoo shots and too many other things to list have we all seen over and over again?!  LOL  <br/> <br/>This is a beautiful shot that is very different than the standard "flower shots"...especially, with bees on them (LOL). <br/> <br/>Frankly, I think that the out of focus petal, across the bottom front welcomes the viewer''s eye to the central focus of the shot....the beautiful, glowing interior of the flower! :)  <br/> <br/>And, sorry, but the comment about "jagged edges detracting from the picture????  What jaggedness and what would it "detract" from?????  (wish there was a puzzled face symbol LOL)  <br/> <br/>Lovely, work!  I like it! Thumbs up from me!  :)  Wish I had have voted in this challenge but, alas, I wasn''t in here during this challenge due to being busy with work.</td>', 'ROFL....MOST things in here have been "beaten to death"!  How many liquid drips, bees, smoke patterns, broken lightbulbs, fireworks, birds, flowers, zoo shots and too many other things to list have we all seen over and over again?!  LOL   This is a beautiful shot that is very different than the standard "flower shots"...especially, with bees on them (LOL).  Frankly, I think that the out of focus petal, across the bottom front welcomes the viewer''s eye to the central focus of the shot....the beautiful, glowing interior of the flower! :)   And, sorry, but the comment about "jagged edges detracting from the picture????  What jaggedness and what would it "detract" from?????  (wish there was a puzzled face symbol LOL)   Lovely, work!  I like it! Thumbs up from me!  :)  Wish I had have voted in this challenge but, alas, I wasn''t in here during this challenge due to being busy with work.', '2010-06-05 22:12:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6043143, 879929, 63244, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture! Excellent blurred background and the detail is very good. I miss our blue birds! :(</td>', 'Beautiful capture! Excellent blurred background and the detail is very good. I miss our blue birds! :(', '2010-06-06 15:07:09.000000', NULL, 0),
