(6359809, 878621, 52115, '<td valign="top">Go, Minoltas! I''ve got a Minolta XD11, with 3 lenses etc. Was my "Film" camera when I was 24. Did shots in Europe and all over, then. I just bought a roll of "Film" for my mothers 35mm Nikon automatic camera fo my mother. (I bought one roll for myself, too)<br/> <br/>I may shoot a "Roll" with all my new knowledge. I''ll still <b>hate the inability to download and edit faster.</b> I haven''t shot "Film" for at least 20 years.<br/> <br/>Some of the younger, new generation of Photographers are "Dicovering" and "Experimenting" wit film. See "Nick Onken" or "Chase Jarvis" for examples.</td>', 'Go, Minoltas! I''ve got a Minolta XD11, with 3 lenses etc. Was my "Film" camera when I was 24. Did shots in Europe and all over, then. I just bought a roll of "Film" for my mothers 35mm Nikon automatic camera fo my mother. (I bought one roll for myself, too) I may shoot a "Roll" with all my new knowledge. I''ll still hate the inability to download and edit faster. I haven''t shot "Film" for at least 20 years. Some of the younger, new generation of Photographers are "Dicovering" and "Experimenting" wit film. See "Nick Onken" or "Chase Jarvis" for examples.', '2011-03-22 09:45:15.000000', NULL, 0),
